   * events the browser actually fires; a business-meaning "moved X onto
   * Y" is what's replayable and readable, the intermediate dragover
   * noise is not. Native, unprevented — this only OBSERVES, it doesn't
   * intercept or hold anything back the way click/submit/Enter do,
   * since drag&drop very rarely triggers an immediate page navigation
   * the way those do. */
  let __aiRecDragSource = null;
